# explainer-stacked (plan section 6, M11): the stacked layout at 800 x 900 has no room right of the
# panel, so the explainer hangs under the chip, its caret up (a's chip, centre (70, 424.5): the card
# at (50, 450.5)), or stands above a chip low in the window, its caret down, reaching away from the
# window's middle (h's chip, centre (70, 573.5): under it the card would run past the window's
# foot). The pointer goes by the top bar between the two, until a's explainer has gone: a's card
# hangs over h's chip, and the engines take a still pointer to what an inert card uncovers at
# different times (the port and Chromium at once, WebKit once the card is gone).
size 800 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 70 424
wait 1104
shot explainer-stacked
move 760 48
wait 304
move 70 573
wait 1104
shot explainer-stacked-h
